WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:02.201
-Welcome back to "Late Night."

00:00:02.201 --> 00:00:03.970
It is almost Halloween,
and here to talk about it

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.405
is one of our writers,
Amber Ruffin.

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:08.541
-Hi, Seth. Hi! Hi!

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:11.177
You know what?
It's finally Halloween.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:14.747
Yay! Halloween is one
of my favorite holidays.

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:16.949
-You know, I have to say, Amber,
I've known you for a while,

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:18.585
and you don't seem
like the Halloween type.

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:21.187
-No, baby, I love Halloween.

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:23.523
Do you want to know why?

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:24.523
-Why?

00:00:24.523 --> 00:00:26.626
[ Mid-tempo music plays ]

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:29.662
-♪ The leaves start falling
from the trees ♪

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:32.232
♪ It's time to come inside ♪

00:00:32.232 --> 00:00:35.001
♪ Grab a big warm cup of cocoa ♪

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:37.837
♪ 'Cause you're in
for quite a ride ♪

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:40.373
♪ The stars have all aligned ♪

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:43.643
♪ And you don't want
to miss this ♪

00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:47.446
♪ Halloween's my favorite time ♪

00:00:47.446 --> 00:00:52.118
♪ 'Cause Halloween
is Christmas ♪

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:53.186
-What?

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:55.454
-Halloween is
the official beginning

00:00:55.454 --> 00:00:56.889
of the Christmas season!

00:00:56.889 --> 00:00:58.924
[ Cheers and applause ]
-No, no.

00:00:58.924 --> 00:01:01.627
It's not.
-Yes, it is!

00:01:01.627 --> 00:01:03.596
-No, we still have
two more months.

00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:06.365
-Everybody knows Christmas
begins on Halloween,

00:01:06.365 --> 00:01:09.769
and it doesn't end until
Martin Luther King Day.

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:11.203
-Absolutely not.

00:01:11.203 --> 00:01:13.039
-It's already here, Seth.

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:15.675
Morning shows are starting
to do Christmas segments.

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:17.443
Christmas sales have started.

00:01:17.443 --> 00:01:19.078
And with supply chain issues,

00:01:19.078 --> 00:01:22.147
if you didn't order your
Christmas presents yesterday,

00:01:22.147 --> 00:01:24.017
it's already too late.

00:01:24.017 --> 00:01:26.118
-We still have Halloween,
Daylight Savings,

00:01:26.118 --> 00:01:27.787
Thanksgiving,
and then Christmas.

00:01:27.787 --> 00:01:29.722
Every year they start this stuff
earlier and earlier.

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:32.057
And it's bad enough when it's
like a month early,

00:01:32.057 --> 00:01:33.092
but two months early?

00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:34.593
I will not tolerate this.

00:01:34.593 --> 00:01:37.830
I asked you out here to sing a
Halloween song, and you agreed.

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:41.567
Agreed?
-Okay, agreed.

00:01:41.567 --> 00:01:43.569
♪ Oh, whoa ♪

00:01:43.569 --> 00:01:45.638
♪ Soon Santa's gonna show ♪

00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:48.975
♪ He'll scurry down my chimney ♪

00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:51.811
♪ October 'neath the mistletoe ♪

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:54.680
♪ Is where I'm gonna be ♪

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:58.951
♪ Halloween's for spending time
with loved ones ♪

00:01:58.951 --> 00:02:00.353
♪ And it's bliss ♪

00:02:00.353 --> 00:02:04.123
♪ Halloween's my favorite time ♪

00:02:04.123 --> 00:02:08.194
♪ 'Cause Halloween
is Christmas ♪

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:09.528
-What you're saying
is impossible.

00:02:09.528 --> 00:02:12.264
Christmas is only one day,
and it's not October 31st.

00:02:12.264 --> 00:02:13.833
-Christmas is not a day.

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:16.536
It's a whole season
like Hot Girl Summer.

00:02:16.536 --> 00:02:19.438
-Amber, every time you say this,
it makes me angrier.

00:02:19.438 --> 00:02:21.173
I cannot believe
you're one of those people

00:02:21.173 --> 00:02:22.642
who starts Christmas
way too early.

00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:24.544
-I honestly feel like
this is something

00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:26.379
you could have
just assumed about me.

00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:28.180
-You're right.
-I am right!

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:30.416
-No! I mean you're right
about me being able to assume

00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:31.784
that you're a Christmas freak,

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:33.853
not that you're right about
Halloween being Christmas.

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:34.987
You're very, very wrong
about that.

00:02:34.987 --> 00:02:36.389
I am putting my foot down.

00:02:36.389 --> 00:02:38.524
I asked you out here
to sing a Halloween song.

00:02:38.524 --> 00:02:39.625
Agreed?

00:02:39.625 --> 00:02:41.093
-Agreed!

00:02:41.093 --> 00:02:44.496
-I am a little worried
that your line is off-camera

00:02:44.496 --> 00:02:46.532
and that when we
cut back to you...

00:02:46.532 --> 00:02:48.267
-♪ Oh, whoa ♪

00:02:48.267 --> 00:02:50.903
♪ It's Halloween, so naturally ♪

00:02:50.903 --> 00:02:53.739
♪ I got Christmas on the brain ♪

00:02:53.739 --> 00:02:56.341
♪ Come trick-or-treating
at my house ♪

00:02:56.341 --> 00:02:59.378
♪ And you'll get a candy cane ♪

00:02:59.378 --> 00:03:04.951
♪ I don't give a rip if all this
puts me on your [bleep] list ♪

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:08.488
♪ Halloween's my favorite time ♪

00:03:08.488 --> 00:03:10.489
Say "why," Seth.

00:03:10.489 --> 00:03:11.857
-No.

00:03:11.857 --> 00:03:16.495
-♪ Halloween's
my favorite time ♪

00:03:16.495 --> 00:03:18.731
Eh?

00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:23.803
♪ Halloween's my favorite time ♪

00:03:23.803 --> 00:03:25.638
-Alright.

00:03:25.638 --> 00:03:30.543
-♪ 'Cause Halloween
is Christmas ♪

00:03:30.543 --> 00:03:32.178
It's Christmas!
Merry Christmas!

00:03:32.178 --> 00:03:34.379
-Get out of here.

00:03:34.379 --> 00:03:37.650
You get out of here.
Your charm does not work on me.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:38.951
Amber Ruffin, everybody.

00:03:38.951 --> 00:03:41.787 line:0%
We'll be right back
with Amanda Seyfried.

00:03:41.787 --> 00:03:43.622 line:0%
-It's Christmas now.

00:03:43.622 --> 00:03:45.091 line:0%
It's Christmas!

